1396 0 obj
<<
/Dest [9 0 R /XYZ 71.982422 210.13513 0]
/Next 1398 0 R
/Parent 4 0 R
/Prev 1393 0 R
/SE 244 0 R
/Title (In the bustling marketplaces of India, both online and offline, the "No-Cost EMI" offer has become a powerful catalyst for commerce. From the latest smartphones and consumer electronics to home appliances and even online education, this financing option has fundamentally altered consumer purchasing behavior, making high-ticket items psychologically and financially more accessible to millions. The proposition is deceptively simple: buy now and pay later in equal monthly installments, with the total price paid being no more than the product's sticker price. This apparent "zero-interest" facility has been a significant driver of consumption, with major e-commerce platforms reporting that a substantial portion of their sales, especially during festive seasons, are routed through EMI options. For instance, during one major sale event, Amazon noted that one in four purchases were made via EMI, with three-quarters of those being "no-cost" EMI.[1] )
>>
endobj
1397 0 obj
<<
/Dest [8 0 R /XYZ 90.169922 143.060547 0]
/Next 1394 0 R
/Parent 4 0 R
/Prev 1399 0 R
