endobj
1398 0 obj
<<
/Dest [236 0 R /XYZ 71.988281 674.73511 0]
/Next 1400 0 R
/Parent 4 0 R
/Prev 1396 0 R
/SE 245 0 R
/Title (This surge in adoption points to a deeper economic and social shift. As India's aspirational middle class expands, so does the demand for consumer goods that were once considered luxuries. EMI schemes bridge the gap between aspiration and affordability, effectively democratizing access to modern lifestyle products. This has been a boon for the economy, stimulating demand, increasing sales volumes for retailers and manufacturers, and fueling the growth of the digital payments ecosystem.[2][3] Studies have shown that the availability of EMI options can increase the average order value of sales and significantly boost conversion rates, transforming window shoppers into actual buyers.[3] )
>>
endobj
1399 0 obj
<<
/Dest [8 0 R /XYZ 90.169922 158.46875 0]
/Next 1397 0 R
