/Title (The investigation reveals that the "no-cost" EMI is not a single product but a sophisticated ecosystem where costs are strategically distributed to create a win-win illusion. Profitability is not absent; it is merely reallocated. The results are presented below, broken down by the core mechanisms and the profitability drivers for each key stakeholder. )
>>
