/Next 1493 0 R
/Parent 4 0 R
/Prev 1498 0 R
/SE 349 0 R
/Title (Future research could take several promising directions. An empirical study using anonymized transaction data from a fintech platform could provide precise quantitative insights into the impact of EMI on sales volume and AOV across different sectors. A large-scale consumer survey could measure the actual level of financial literacy regarding "no-cost" EMIs and assess the impact of these schemes on household savings and debt behavior. Finally, a comparative analysis of installment credit models in other emerging economies could provide valuable lessons for India's regulatory and market development. )
>>
endobj
