/Title (This study is based on publicly available secondary data, and as such, it cannot capture the specific, confidential terms of agreements between individual banks and merchants. The profitability margins and subvention rates likely vary significantly across products, brands, and retailers. Therefore, the quantitative estimates provided should be seen as illustrative rather than exact. )
>>
endobj
