/SE 337 0 R
/Title (While the "no-cost" EMI model is legally compliant, its marketing and presentation raise ethical questions about transparency. The term "no-cost" is inherently misleading, as this analysis has shown there are definite, quantifiable costs. Consumers are often unaware of the full cost breakdown, particularly the GST on interest and the loss of upfront discounts or rewards. )
>>
endobj
