1541 0 obj
<<
/Count 1
/Dest [14 0 R /XYZ 71.988281 283.39844 0]
/First 1543 0 R
/Last 1543 0 R
/Next 1539 0 R
/Parent 4 0 R
/Prev 1544 0 R
/SE 326 0 R
/Title (This interdependence creates a powerful network effect. The more consumers adopt EMI, the more merchants are compelled to offer it. The more merchants offer it, the more banks and fintechs invest in the infrastructure, creating a self-reinforcing loop that has cemented EMI as a cornerstone of Indian retail finance.[2] )
>>
endobj
